    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grandpa Rat~!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you out here all alone, little one? And your face is filthy. Were you crawling through air ducts again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, Uncle Ho gave this to me, Grandpa Rat! Uncle Ho said I'm small and I run fast, and if I got this to you quick enough he'd give me a yogurt. You have to tell him I did it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, Grandpa will tell him. Now you run along.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, Grandpa! Bye byee~!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_033"
    },
    {
        "text": "Something wrong, Uncle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seemingly Ordinary Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkalley_intro",
        "key": "$darkalley_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you recall those Siracusans who came looking for us some time ago? The rest of their 'Family' has since come to Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Should I contact our spy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seemingly Ordinary Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No need for that. Let us bide our time. They will come to us on their own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seemingly Ordinary Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "To survive in Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's not like they need anyone's permission for that. They might as well take a meeting with a Catastrophe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seemingly Ordinary Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#9"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Catastrophes could speak, maybe we wouldn't need to fight each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...it's just like you said, Mr. Rat King.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Lungmen. Lungmen's got its own rules Wei Yenwu agreed to a decade ago. We ain't about to go breakin' 'em.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you're the executive. That's why we're here to pay our respects.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...You want to wipe out Penguin Logistics, and take their place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Exactly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't know much about them, Sicilians. This deal would not be of benefit to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Gambino!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you tryin' to tell us we can't win? Mr. 'Rat King'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Winning and losing are words that have no place in a business discussion. No wonder you had to flee Siracusa. You are no match for that woman.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You insult the Family?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gambino"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Quiet, Gambino! We're after Penguin Logistics here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You need only follow the rules. I am not here to protect Penguin Logistics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Penguin Logistics is on its face a legal entity. The only thing that can protect it is the ironclad law of Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they do, from time to time, cause offense to various stakeholders. And they never take it appropriately seriously.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "But bear in mind, Sicilians, you must never overstep your bounds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "An unconventional order is not the same as disorder. Siracusans should understand this more than anyone. But you must never again bring trouble to these old bones of mine. Promise me that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_027",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Capone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
