        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are so many more stars in Lungmen this time of year. So many more than you'd think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "The tea on the table has gone cold, hasn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$gorgeousdebut_intro",
        "key": "$gorgeousdebut_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is Uncle's... Hey, we're on the clock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passerby"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not deaf. I'm on it. Once I'm done let's go get tea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passerby"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like it's our turn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "text": "We paid our respects, put down our crossbows, and made sure not to hurt any civilians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "text": "...all nice and proper-like under the new rules.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "So we're surrounded? Six or so deep on all sides?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#5",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, like a roll cake?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Rat King is the boss of the slums. Of course his claws and teeth are everywhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why didn't you say so earlier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought he was just an urban legend. And I never imagined he'd actually be a rat. Who would take a nickname like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "With all them people around, it's too hard to tell who's after us and who's a passerby!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have a lot of room to act here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're always asking what to do. Don't you ever think for yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here they come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here you are. I think you can make out the situation from up here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your friends are locked in a life or death struggle. Aren't you going to help them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "From what I've heard of you, I never thought you'd be so heavy handed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't share every last thought of mine with the young people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure enough. I always forget what kind of person you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Many have forgotten as much. And they all ended up six feet deep in an unmarked grave. You're already among the luckiest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You killed the boss. You think that'll just blow over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh heh. It's all very clear to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "The owner of Penguin Logistics has always acted so prideful, as if above everyone else. But Lungmen is changing. She cannot allow this to continue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "text": "They needed to be taught a lesson. And a very harsh one at that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's always a comeuppance when you bite the hand that feeds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've done so much with the help of Penguin Logistics...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, were you planning this from the very beginning?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who knows?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rat King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_034#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Couldn't be. Your whole act is way too good. Or, at least it's better than mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "ac5_6",
        "xScale": 0.9,
        "yScale": 0.9,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
