    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Bison, don't just sit there like a bump on a log. Yer in my way! Move it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're all... it's all... how can I...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I can't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "All right. If that's how it has to be, we'll do it their way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
