        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Young Master... I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Butler"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't blame you. I'm sure it was all my father's machinations. But right here, right now, I need you to help me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Of course. Give me your instructions, Young Master.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Butler"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really think this is a time for instructions?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just send them flying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "To hear such an order from the mouth of the Young Master...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Butler"
    },
    {
        "text": "Allow me to advocate for the Master of the House and ask: why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Butler"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who gives a shit why? Out of my way, Croissant!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haaagh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
